Package: fbi
Title: R Wrapper for the FBI Crime Data Explorer (CDE) API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Jared E.",
           family = "Knowles",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "1+jared@noreply.localhost")
Author: Jared E. Knowles [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Jared E. Knowles <1+jared@noreply.localhost>
Description: An R wrapper for the FBI Crime Data Explorer (CDE) API
    (<https://cde.ucr.cjis.gov/LATEST/>) providing access to UCR and NIBRS
    crime data. Functions cover lookups (agencies, offense codes, states),
    summarized crime data, arrest statistics, NIBRS incident-level data,
    Supplemental Homicide Reports (SHR), and police employment statistics.
    No API key is required for the current CDE host. Based on the original
    fbi package by Jacob Kaplan (https://github.com/jacobkap/fbi).
